{
"source": "force-aligned to media/song.wav (torchaudio CTC, wav2vec2 large); machine estimate",
"lines": [
{
"text": "God remembered Noe,",
"start": 15.921,
"end": 17.621
},
{
"text": "and every beast and bird,",
"start": 20.121,
"end": 22.301
},
{
"text": "every herd and creeping thing",
"start": 24.181,
"end": 26.542
},
{
"text": "that shared the ark with him.",
"start": 27.602,
"end": 29.922
},
{
"text": "God sent a wind across the earth;",
"start": 32.382,
"end": 34.862
},
{
"text": "the waters began to fall.",
"start": 36.202,
"end": 38.662
},
{
"text": "The springs of the deep were closed,",
"start": 40.442,
"end": 43.023
},
{
"text": "heaven\u2019s floodgates shut;",
"start": 43.083,
"end": 45.203
},
{
"text": "the rain from heaven was held back.",
"start": 47.603,
"end": 50.103
},
{
"text": "The waters ebbed from all the earth.",
"start": 51.443,
"end": 54.103
},
{
"text": "After one hundred fifty days",
"start": 55.103,
"end": 58.203
},
{
"text": "they had fallen; the ark came to rest,",
"start": 58.363,
"end": 63.864
},
{
"text": "in month seven, day twenty-seven,",
"start": 64.824,
"end": 67.304
},
{
"text": "on Ararat\u2019s mountains.",
"start": 68.224,
"end": 70.504
},
{
"text": "The waters kept on falling",
"start": 70.684,
"end": 74.064
},
{
"text": "until the tenth month.",
"start": 74.364,
"end": 75.804
},
{
"text": "On the first day of month ten,",
"start": 76.564,
"end": 79.5
},
{
"text": "the mountain peaks came into view.",
"start": 92.725,
"end": 95.566
},
{
"text": "After forty days, Noe opened",
"start": 96.346,
"end": 98.626
},
{
"text": "the window he had made in the ark.",
"start": 100.766,
"end": 103.266
},
{
"text": "He sent a raven out;",
"start": 103.566,
"end": 104.966
},
{
"text": "it flew until the earth was dry,",
"start": 106.206,
"end": 109.086
},
{
"text": "and did not come back.",
"start": 109.146,
"end": 112.687
},
{
"text": "Then he sent a dove to learn",
"start": 114.707,
"end": 116.747
},
{
"text": "if waters had withdrawn from earth.",
"start": 118.327,
"end": 120.347
},
{
"text": "The dove found no place to rest;",
"start": 122.047,
"end": 124.547
},
{
"text": "water still covered all the earth.",
"start": 125.087,
"end": 127.807
},
{
"text": "She came back to Noe in the ark.",
"start": 129.108,
"end": 131.808
},
{
"text": "He reached and drew her in,",
"start": 133.388,
"end": 135.708
},
{
"text": "held her close inside.",
"start": 136.448,
"end": 139.308
},
{
"text": "He waited seven more days,",
"start": 140.028,
"end": 142.908
},
{
"text": "then sent the dove out again.",
"start": 144.268,
"end": 149.909
},
{
"text": "At evening she came back,",
"start": 152.849,
"end": 154.549
},
{
"text": "an olive leaf held in her beak.",
"start": 156.149,
"end": 158.209
},
{
"text": "Noe knew the waters had withdrawn.",
"start": 159.609,
"end": 162.329
},
{
"text": "He waited seven more days,",
"start": 163.19,
"end": 165.43
},
{
"text": "then sent the dove out once more.",
"start": 165.53,
"end": 169.07
},
{
"text": "She did not return again.",
"start": 169.45,
"end": 173.05
},
{
"text": "In Noe\u2019s six hundred first year,",
"start": 174.55,
"end": 176.93
},
{
"text": "first month, the first day,",
"start": 178.49,
"end": 180.711
},
{
"text": "the waters had ebbed from earth.",
"start": 181.651,
"end": 193.36
},
{
"text": "Noe opened the ark\u2019s covering",
"start": 195.071,
"end": 200.492
},
{
"text": "and saw the ground was dry.",
"start": 201.572,
"end": 203.872
},
{
"text": "In month two, on day twenty-seven,",
"start": 204.052,
"end": 207.632
},
{
"text": "the earth was dry.",
"start": 209.112,
"end": 211.152
},
{
"text": "The Lord God spoke to Noe:",
"start": 212.852,
"end": 215.073
},
{
"text": "\u201cCome out of the ark,",
"start": 221.333,
"end": 222.653
},
{
"text": "you, your wife, your sons,",
"start": 223.473,
"end": 226.033
},
{
"text": "and your sons\u2019 wives with you.",
"start": 226.153,
"end": 228.173
},
{
"text": "Bring out every creature with you:",
"start": 229.153,
"end": 231.694
},
{
"text": "birds, beasts, all living flesh,",
"start": 232.454,
"end": 235.774
},
{
"text": "everything that crawls on earth.",
"start": 235.914,
"end": 237.974
},
{
"text": "Let them teem and multiply;",
"start": 239.074,
"end": 241.394
},
{
"text": "let them fill the earth.\u201d",
"start": 241.474,
"end": 245.294
},
{
"text": "Noe came out with his wife,",
"start": 245.634,
"end": 250.155
},
{
"text": "his sons and their wives.",
"start": 250.235,
"end": 252.095
},
{
"text": "Every beast and herd,",
"start": 252.235,
"end": 253.915
},
{
"text": "every bird and creeping thing,",
"start": 254.115,
"end": 256.315
},
{
"text": "each by its kind,",
"start": 256.455,
"end": 257.935
},
{
"text": "came out of the ark.",
"start": 258.195,
"end": 259.435
},
{
"text": "Noe built an altar to the Lord.",
"start": 259.875,
"end": 264.175
},
{
"text": "From every clean beast and bird",
"start": 264.195,
"end": 267.236
},
{
"text": "he offered whole burnt offerings.",
"start": 267.316,
"end": 269.596
},
{
"text": "The Lord God received the pleasing scent",
"start": 270.536,
"end": 274.076
},
{
"text": "and said within himself:",
"start": 275.156,
"end": 277.416
},
{
"text": "\u201cI will not curse the earth again",
"start": 278.056,
"end": 281.376
},
{
"text": "for what humanity has done.",
"start": 282.336,
"end": 284.757
},
{
"text": "The human heart leans toward evil",
"start": 286.117,
"end": 288.517
},
{
"text": "even from youth.",
"start": 289.757,
"end": 293.197
},
{
"text": "I will not strike down all life again",
"start": 293.337,
"end": 297.957
},
{
"text": "as I have done.\u201d",
"start": 300.878,
"end": 302.798
},
{
"text": "All earth\u2019s days shall keep their rhythm:",
"start": 308.71,
"end": 311.778
},
{
"text": "seedtime, harvest, cold and heat,",
"start": 314.158,
"end": 317.85
},
{
"text": "summer, spring, day and night\u2014",
"start": 320.839,
"end": 324.659
},
{
"text": "none shall cease.\u201d",
"start": 326.779,
"end": 329.019
}
],
